{"speciesId":87,"names":{"fr":"Lamantine","es":"Dewgong","en":"Dewgong","ja":"ジュゴン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"Stores thermal energy in its body. Swims at a steady 8 knots even in intensely cold waters."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"Stores thermal energy in its body. Swims at a steady 8 knots even in intensely cold waters."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"Its entire body is a snowy-white. Unharmed by even intense cold, it swims powerfully in icy waters."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"Its streamlined body has little drag in water. The colder the temperature, the friskier it gets."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It loves frigid seas with ice floes. It uses its long tail to change swimming direction quickly."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It sleeps under shallow ocean waters during the day, then looks for food at night when it's cold."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"DEWGONG loves to snooze on bitterly cold ice. The sight of this POKéMON sleeping on a glacier was mistakenly thought to be a mermaid by a mariner long ago."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"DEWGONG loves to snooze on bitterly cold ice. The sight of this POKéMON sleeping on a glacier was mistakenly thought to be a mermaid by a mariner long ago."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It loves to snooze on bitterly cold ice. The sight of this POKéMON sleeping on a glacier was mistakenly thought to be a mermaid by a mariner long ago."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Its body is covered with a pure white fur. The colder the weather, the more active it becomes."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It stores thermal energy in the body. It swims at a steady eight knots even in intensely cold waters."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"In snow, the pure white coat covering its body obscures it from predators."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"In snow, the pure white coat covering its body obscures it from predators."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"In snow, the pure white coat covering its body obscures it from predators."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its streamlined body has little drag in water. The colder the temperature, the friskier it gets."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It loves frigid seas with ice floes. It uses its long tail to change swimming direction quickly."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Son corps est couvert d’un grand manteau blanc qui, dans la neige, le dissimule aux yeux des prédateurs."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"In snow, the pure white coat covering its body obscures it from predators."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Son corps est couvert d’un grand manteau blanc qui, dans la neige, le dissimule aux yeux des prédateurs."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"In snow, the pure white coat covering its body obscures it from predators."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Its streamlined body has low resistance, and it swims around cold oceans at a speed of eight knots."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Its streamlined body has low resistance, and it swims around cold oceans at a speed of eight knots."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Son corps est recouvert d’une fourrure d’un blanc pur. Plus il fait froid, et plus ce Pokémon est actif."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Está recubierto de un luminoso pelaje blanco. Este Pokémon aumenta su actividad cuando bajan las temperaturas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its body is covered with a pure white fur. The colder the weather, the more active it becomes."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"全身が 真っ白な 毛で 覆われている。寒さに 強く むしろ 寒いほど 元気になる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Son corps hydrodynamique glisse dans l’eau. Plus l’eau est froide plus il se sent à l’aise."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Su aerodinámico cuerpo avanza fácilmente por el agua. Cuanto más fría, más diversión."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Its streamlined body has little drag in water. The colder the temperature, the friskier it gets."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"体は 水の 抵抗が 少ない 流線型。 寒くなるほど 元気が 出てくる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Lamantine adore piquer un roupillon à même la glace. Il y a très longtemps, un marin ayant aperçu ce Pokémon dormant sur un glacier a cru voir une sirène."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"A Dewgong le encanta dormitar sobre la frialdad del hielo. Antiguamente, algún que otro marino lo confundió con una sirena al verlo dormido sobre un glaciar."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Dewgong loves to snooze on bitterly cold ice. The sight of this Pokémon sleeping on a glacier was mistakenly thought to be a mermaid by a mariner long ago."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"冷たい 氷の 上で 寝るのが 大好き。 昔 氷山で 眠る 姿を 見た 船乗りが 人魚と 間違えた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Lamantine adore piquer un roupillon à même la glace. Il y a très longtemps, un marin ayant aperçu ce Pokémon dormant sur un glacier a cru voir une sirène."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"A Dewgong le encanta dormitar sobre la frialdad del hielo. Antiguamente, algún que otro marino lo confundió con una sirena al verlo dormido sobre un glaciar."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Dewgong loves to snooze on bitterly cold ice. The sight of this Pokémon sleeping on a glacier was mistakenly thought to be a mermaid by a mariner long ago."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"冷たい 氷の 上で 寝るのが 大好き。 昔 氷山で 眠る 姿を 見た 船乗りが 人魚と 間違えた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il sillonne les mers à la recherche de ses proies à une vitesse de 8 nœuds. Il raffole des Froussardine."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Surca los mares a velocidades de 8 nudos en busca de Pokémon que le sirvan de sustento. Siente predilección especial por los Wishiwashi."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It swims through the ocean at a speed of eight knots, searching for Pokémon that will become its prey. It’s especially fond of Wishiwashi."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"８ノットの 速度で 海を 泳ぎ 獲物である ポケモンを 探す。 特に ヨワシが 大好物。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Après manger, il s’étale de tout son long sur les plages de sable fin. Le soleil le réchauffe et facilite sa digestion."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Le gusta tenderse al sol en la playa después de comer, ya que aumentar su temperatura corporal le facilita la digestión."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It sunbathes on the beach after meals. The rise in its body temperature helps its digestion."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"食事の 後は 砂浜で 日光浴を している。 体温を あげて 消化を よく するのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Son corps entier est aussi blanc que la neige. Il résiste bien au froid et peut même nager au milieu des icebergs."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Su cuerpo es blanco como la nieve. Puede nadar plácidamente en mares gélidos gracias a su resistencia al frío."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Its entire body is a snowy white. Unharmed by even intense cold, it swims powerfully in icy waters."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"全身 雪のように 真っ白。 寒さに強く 氷が 浮かぶ 海も 元気よく 泳ぎまわる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Son corps entier est aussi blanc que la neige. Il résiste bien au froid et peut même nager au milieu des icebergs."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Su cuerpo es blanco como la nieve. Puede nadar plácidamente en mares gélidos gracias a su resistencia al frío."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Its entire body is a snowy white. Unharmed by even